<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ā^răbĭus</span></b> 
		(incorrectly <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arr-</span></b> , v. Arabia),
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀράβιος</span>, a secondary form of Arabus and Arabs, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>Arabian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">advecti ad Arabiam terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Trin. 4, 2, 88</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">odor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Poen. 5, 4, 6</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">Charis. p. 99</span></i> P. reads
			Arabus): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bombyx,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 3, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">limen,</span>”
				<i>furnished with Arabian curtains</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					1, 14, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus capparis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 23, 44, § 127</span></i>
			 Jan.</div>
